ARWindowAlign 插件许可协议 v1.1 / ARWindowAlign Plugin Licence v1.1
========================================================================

本协议仅约束本插件自身的代码与文档。随包附带的第三方组件（Lib.Harmony 等）
适用其各自许可，见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。
This licence covers this plugin's own code and documentation only. Bundled
third-party components keep their own licences (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).

一、允许 / Permitted
----------------
1. 免费使用、复制、修改本插件。/
   Free use, copying and modification of this plugin.
2. 免费分发原版，或你修改后的版本。/
   Free redistribution of the original or of your modified version.

二、关于销售 / Sales
--------------
1. 未做实质性独立开发之前，不得将本插件（原版，或仅作非关键修改的版本）
   以任何形式直接或间接用于销售、收费、付费墙、捆绑销售，或换取任何形式的对价。/
   Until a substantial independent development is made, this plugin (the original,
   or a version carrying only non-critical changes) must not be used directly or
   indirectly for sale, charging, paywalls, bundling, or any other consideration.
2. 「非关键修改」包括但不限于：更换其它语言的翻译文本、调整执行顺序、
   重命名变量/文件、替换图标或文案、简单的兼容性适配等不影响功能实质的改动。
   这些改动不构成可销售的理由。/
   "Non-critical changes" include, but are not limited to: translating text or
   word lists into other languages, changing execution order, renaming variables
   or files, replacing icons or wording, and simple compatibility tweaks —
   changes that do not alter the substance of the functionality.
3. 仅当你做出了实质性的独立更新与优化（例如新增功能、重写核心逻辑、
   显著提升性能或稳定性等），你的那个版本方可视为可销售；且销售范围仅限
   你所新增或重写的部分。/ Only after a substantial independent update or
   optimisation (new features, rewritten core logic, significant performance or
   stability improvements, ...) may your version be considered sellable, and only
   the parts you added or rewrote may be sold.
4. 若本插件因 ETS2LA 或游戏版本更新而失效，且自本插件失效之日起已满一周、作者仍未更新，
   允许他人在仅做恢复可用性的简单修复后销售该修改版本。
   上述一周自插件失效之日起算，不以插件的上传或最后更新日期起算。/
   If this plugin stops working after an update to ETS2LA or the game, and its author
   has not updated it within one week of that point, selling a version repaired just
   enough to work again is permitted. The week counts from the moment the plugin stops
   working, not from the plugin's upload or last-update date.
5. 作者恢复更新后，上述基于简单修复的销售应当立即停止。/
   Such sales must stop immediately once the author resumes updating.
6. 作者恢复更新之前已经完成的销售不受影响。/
   Sales completed before the author resumed updating are not affected.

三、分发 / Redistribution
---------------------
1. 在上述前提下免费分发，无需事先取得许可。/
   Free redistribution under the conditions above requires no prior permission.
2. 分发时不得移除或修改本协议与版权声明。/
   The licence and copyright notice must not be removed or altered.

四、免责 / Disclaimer
-----------------
本插件按「现状」提供，不提供任何明示或暗示的担保。/
Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

五、其它 / Miscellaneous
--------------------
1. 本协议不授予 ETS2LA、Euro Truck Simulator 2 / American Truck Simulator
   及相关商标的任何权利。/ No rights to those projects or trademarks are granted.
2. 与第三方组件许可冲突时，以第三方组件自身许可为准。/
   Third-party component licences prevail where they conflict.

